ps://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/e4ddac12-f48f-4455-8e8d-c2a48a683437.cxg/\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023016 \"A transcriptomically distinct GABAergic neuron derived from the CGE and that expresses the vasoactive intestinal polypeptide. Its soma is located in the forebrain.\")\n\n  Line 30053: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ILX:0770151\") oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:CL_4023016 \"Vip GABAergic neuron\")\n\n  Line 30070: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27477017\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33742131\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/9c63201d-bfd9-41a8-bbbc-18d947556f3d.cxg/\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023017 \"A transcriptomically distinct GABAergic neuron located in the cerebral cortex that expresses somatostatin (sst) and derived from the MGE.\")\n\n  Line 33507: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/e4ddac12-f48f-4455-8e8d-c2a48a683437.cxg/\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4042032 \"A transcriptomically distinct GABAergic neuron, located in the cerebral cortex and derived from the CGE, that expresses the transcript PAX6.\")\n\n  Line 33560: # Class: obo:CL_4042037 (sst GABAergic neuron of the striatum)\n\n  Line 33567: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30467465\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:33742131\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4042037 \"Some striatal SST GABAergic neurons can co-release glutamate and generate excitation-inhibition responses in postsynaptic neurons. This interneuron type has the least dense dendritic branches in the striatum. In the dorsomedial striatum these neurons regulate the activity of striatal projection neurons.\")\n\n  Line 33568: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4042037 \"sst GABAergic neuron of the striatum\"@en)\n\n  Line 33588: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref 